  "cr001_note": "CR-001 (GD-2026-10-25-01, ScriptLock 1.2): BOOT -> STORY_START (C00, C01, C02-A) -> STORY_SWIM (C02-B) -> STORY_START (C02-C..F) -> TITLE_CARD -> MAIN_MENU (E1). New life: NEW_GAME -> CHAPTER_CARD -> IN_GAME with the life of the story start, or NEW_GAME -> STORY_START -> ... -> CHAPTER_CARD when none is pending (returning player). PAUSE_MENU <-> STORY_SWIM and ACCESSIBILITY (auto swim, E2)."
